{
  "title": "PEAL: PyTorch Explain and Adapt Library",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "PEAL is a PyTorch library for generating visual counterfactual explanations and for correcting classifiers and foundation-model probes with them. It contains the official implementations of Smoothed Counterfactual Explorer (SCE), Counterfactual Knowledge Distillation (CFKD) and Disentangled Diffusion Autoencoders (DiDAE), alongside reimplementations of commonly used counterfactual explainers and robustification methods.",
